{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"ben-falcone","name":"Ben Falcone","birthDate":"1973-08-25","birthPlace":"Carbondale, Illinois, USA","bio":"Benjamin Scott Falcone (born August 25, 1973) is an American actor, comedian and filmmaker. He is married to actress Melissa McCarthy, with whom he frequently collaborates. Falcone made his directorial debut in 2014 with Tammy, which he co-wrote with McCarthy. He also directed, co-wrote, and produced The Boss, Life of the Party, Superintelligence, and Thunder Force, all of which starred McCarthy. In 2022, Falcone starred in the Netflix series God's Favorite Idiot, which he created.\n\nHe has also had cameos in Bridesmaids, Identity Thief, The Heat, Spy, Can You Ever Forgive Me?, and Nine Perfect Strangers, all of which starred his wife.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia Ben Falcone, article licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:53:15+00:00","tmdbId":170820,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/170820","credits":[{"id":"thor-love","title":"Thor: Love and Thunder","character":"Asgardian Stage Manager"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/ben-falcone.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Thor: Love and Thunder","year":2022,"character":"Asgardian Stage Manager","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pIkRyD18kl4FhoCNQuWxWu5cBLM.jpg"},{"name":"God's Favorite Idiot","year":2022,"character":"Clark Thompson","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3lCe1vzmHvKCHLFz2tYYoArux1Q.jpg"},{"name":"Thunder Force","year":2021,"character":"Kenny","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3mKMWP5OokB7QpcOMA1yl8BXFAF.jpg"},{"name":"Nine Perfect Strangers","year":2021,"character":"Paul Drabble","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oPcqsZIFHrv7HoGgFQnsGDiPulD.jpg"},{"name":"FOX Presents the iHeart Living Room Concert for America","year":2020,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https: